{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52889","headline":"诗 · 张怀瓘","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向展右背，长伸左足。\n峻角一支，潜虚半腹。\n已放则留，无垂不缩。\n分若抵背，合还口并目。\n似侧暎斜，似斜附曲。\n覃精一字，工归自得。\n盈虚统视联行，妙在相承起伏。\n（均见宋朱长文《墨池编》卷二引张怀瓘《玉堂禁经》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张怀瓘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}